  "body": "`SerialOptions` has:\n\n    [EnforceRange] required unsigned long baudRate;\n\nIn Web IDL, extended attributes before `required` apply to the dictionary member rather than its type, and [EnforceRange] can't be used on dictionary members (whatwg/webidl#691; whatwg/webidl#1624 makes this explicit). This should be:\n\n    required [EnforceRange] unsigned long baudRate;\n",
